 "realmCaveat": "Every `live` / `liveEvidence` verdict is a CONQUEST OF AZEROTH verdict. The payload comes from the 'voljin' builder URL (https://ascension.gg/en/v2/coa-builder/voljin), but Vol'jin and Rexxar are two realms of the SAME game mode (gameMode=11) reading the same base chain, so this is a mode-wide capture and there is no per-realm CoA split - do not read 'voljin' in a filename as a scope limit. The limits that ARE real: (1) TIME - the published builder drifts from this repo's client snapshot, so content the builder has not caught up to reads as dead; (2) data/classes/ entries are account-wide across all four realms, so an entry belonging to another game mode is correctly dead FOR CoA while being alive on the mode that owns it.",
